-- title:
--   Exact E8 first-cell endpoint witnesses
-- statement:
--   Exact integer data for sixteen endpoint enclosures on the eight padded E8 first-cell inverse brackets. At dyadic precision 160, each lower and upper endpoint has its saved exponential and logarithm witnesses, stable graph inputs, and output interval. A single logarithm-of-two interval and witness are shared. These definitions encode the source numerical certificate without assuming that any check accepts; the separate endpoint theorems verify the finite checks and derive their real-valued enclosures.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean/blob/04b6fc3f75b10c3c43702a883ddf888b0608a9a0/browse/GeneralCK/Certificates/E8TAxisFirstCellEndpointWitnesses.lean#L21-L441

