/-!
# Endpoint certificates for all eight padded first-cell inverse brackets

Generated by `scripts/e8_taxis_emit_endpoint_witnesses.py`.
All primitive checks, scalar graph identities, and target comparisons
are checked separately. Coverage follows from the intermediate value theorem.
The exact lower cell boundaries are those in `E8TAxisOneCellGeometry`.
-/

